# NO DATA FILE IS EVER COMMITTED TO THIS REPOSITORY.
#
# NSE and NSE Indices both prohibit redistribution of their data in writing
# (see the data note in README.md). Every input here is fetched at runtime by
# a script in src/ and cached locally.
#
# The whole data/ tree is excluded rather than a list of known filenames, so a
# new input added later cannot reach a commit by someone forgetting to update
# this file. That is the difference between this and the private repository's
# .gitignore, which named five cache directories and left the derived CSVs
# tracked.
data/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.mypy_cache/
